meta {
  name: The holiday teaches nothing
  type: http
  seq: 78
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/timetable-occurrences?branch_id={{branchId}}&date=2026-11-03
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  X-School-Id: {{schoolCode}}
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 200
  res.body.count: eq 0
}

docs {
  Closed days are skipped before slots are even looked at, so a holiday
  produces nothing regardless of what is timetabled on that weekday. The same
  empty answer comes back for a date with no calendar row at all, and for a
  date whose calendar row has no schedule attached - three different causes,
  one indistinguishable result. That is the thing to remember when a
  timetable looks empty for no reason.
}
